# Private research and planning written for asp67, not part of the project. Listed
# rather than merely left untracked: this remote is public, and an untracked file is
# one `git add -A` away from being published irreversibly.
FEASIBILITY-REVIEW.md
*-REVIEW.md
# Thumbnail/scene scratch for the video build, which lives outside this repo.
thumb_*.html

# Exported model catalogues — these can contain API keys in plain text. NEVER commit.
llm-colosseum-models.json
when-agents-rule-models.json
arenaConfig*.json
*.secrets.json

# What a run leaves behind: match transcripts, exported results, QA screenshots.
# Untracked is not enough here — these carry real opponent spend and full match data, and
# an untracked file is one `git add -A` away from being published on a public remote.
results_*.md
match-*.jsonl
screenshots/
